## Instalação

### Via npx (recomendado)

```bash
npx gbit-container
```

### Via pip

```bash
pip install gbit-container
```

### Via clone com gbit-start

```bash
gbit-start  https://github.com/gislaine-programadora/gbit_container.git
cd gbit-container
pip install -e .
pip install click rich flask pyyaml psutil
```

